      ⍝ regression (Blake McBride, Bugs12.md #5, 2026-08-06): 43 ⎕CR B used
      ⍝ to abort (Assertion failed: !value->is_simple_scalar() in
      ⍝ next_ravel_Pointer, Value.icc:172) whenever B's parse folded to a
      ⍝ single simple-scalar TOK_APL_VALUE token (e.g. '2', '1+2', 'A←1');
      ⍝ next_ravel_Value() (which already handles both the simple-scalar
      ⍝ and nested cases) is used now instead of next_ravel_Pointer().
      ⍝
